As of 2026, Savannah couldn't provide anonymous browsing for CVS and SVN
repositories due to high loads.  As one partial work-around, an authenticated
browsing for logged-in Savannah users was arranged.  With this setup, Savane
automatically replaces browsing URLs for logged-in users with links
to the proxied ViewVC instance that serves the repositories.  Savane can either
use a URL like http://localhost:49152 or a path to the viewvc.cgi script
written to the $sys_viewvc variable in savane.conf.php:

  $sys_viewvc = 'http://localhost:49512';

  $sys_viewvc = '/opt/viewvc/bin/cgi/viewvc.cgi';

If a URL is used, ViewVC should be have server's 'script alias' set to 'vc'
in its configuration to align with Savane URLs.

